'''Apple Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.7 Update|Version 5.7]] gains Area Attack and increases [[Freeze|freeze]] chance to 100%. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 9.10 Update|Version 9.10]].

