==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Face Cat''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''iCat''' at level 30 using [[Catfruit]] and XP.

==Strategy/Usage==
It is not recommended to rely much on this Cat prior to unlocking its True Form. It can be nice against a lone [[Bore]] or [[One Horn]], but he is rarely worth bringing over the more reliable [[Witch Cat (Rare Cat)|Witch Cat]], since she can be stacked and survives longer because of this.

==='''True Form'''===
iCat is a massive improvement over Apple Cat and Face Cat. With Area Attacks and a guaranteed freeze, this unit becomes invaluable against most Red Enemies, shining the most against Bores, this time even in hordes, [[Shy Boy]]s, [[Capy|Capies]] and almost all common red peons. With alternating attacks from only two iCats, short ranged Red enemies can be permanently frozen as long as you desire. In stages such as [[Bombergirl (Deadly)|Deeply Dreaming]], this gives a massive advantage by allowing time to build up money or stack [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance units]].

With help from 40% Freeze [[Cat Combo|Combos]] and all [[Blood Fruit]] treasures, a single iCat can perma-freeze any Red Enemy by himself! Even 30% Freeze Combos already give iCat an impressive 96% Freeze uptime. Some setup may be required to reach certain enemies in the first place, though.

==='''Talents'''===
Although Speed Up would help iCat reach [[Hannya]] between attacks or avoid certain [[Long Distance]] attacks more reliably, it usually ends up causing iCat to run forward too much every time the line advances, putting this unit in danger. Health Up and the two resistances are nice at most, but they will rarely make a visible difference, at least unless one wants to go all out with health, possibly through granting this unit + levels, [[Catseye]]s or a Talent Orb. Attack Up makes this unit worse at stalling, only to improve an already low DPS, so it's also not worth the investment.

==='''Orb'''===
Defense up against Reds would be the best choice earlier on since it will tank more hits from reds. Later, Death [[Mini-Surge]] is better.

