==Trivia==
*[[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.6 Update|Version 2.0.6]] increased Apple Cat's freeze chance from 10% to 40% and range from 150 to 180.
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Apple Cat was a part of four other [[Cat Combo]]s: [[William Tell (Removed Combo)|William Tell]], [[Breakfast (Removed Combo)|Breakfast]], [[Roasted Apple (Removed Combo)|Roasted Apple]] and [[Grocery Cart (Removed Combo)|Grocery Cart]].
*Prior to [[Version 15.7 Update|Version 15.7]], Apple Cat's descriptions read as follows:
<pre>Apple Cat
Found a giant apple floating in a river.
Decided to use that as a costume.
Might stop Red enemies.</pre>
<pre>Face Cat
Found a giant head sitting on the road.
Decided to use that as a costume.
Might stop Red enemies.</pre>
<pre>iCat
Found a colorful apple near Silicon
Valley while turtleneck shopping one day.
Area attacks 100% stop Red enemies.</pre>
*Face Cat is implied to be using a dead version of [[The Face]] in its Japanese description.
*iCat contains a variety of references to [[wikipedia:Apple Inc.|Apple Inc.]]:
**The apple's colors are a reference to Apple's first [[wikipedia:Marketing of Apple Inc.#Logo|official logo]], only iCat has them in the opposite order and without purple.
**The Cat inside the apple resembles [[wikipedia:Steve Jobs|Steve Jobs]], the co-founder of the company Apple.
**iCat's English description mentions [[wikipedia:Silicon Valley|Silicon Valley]], where Apple Inc. is currently headquartered.
**iCat's English name comes from most Apple products having a lowercase i before the name, such as the iPhone.
*The Cat inside Apple Cat's first two forms bears some resemblance to [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Hip Hop Cat]].
*Face Cat heavily resembles a boss from ''[[wikipedia:Harmful Park|Harmful Park]]'' that appears to be Frankenstein's monster, but opens up its head to reveal a cat dancing in a manner identical to Apple Cat. The animation can be seen in the [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)/Gallery|Gallery]].
*Apple Cat's attack animation can be seen in the opening of the manga ''[[wikipedia:Sazae-san|Sazae-san]]''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s anime adaption done by Tama the Cat. The animation can be seen in the [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)/Gallery|Gallery]].

